    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「うん。ふつうに喋ったほうが絶対いいよ、えっと龍泉寺さん。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「そういえば下の名前はちょっと異国っぽいけど、苗字はうちの国っぽい……かな？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「龍泉寺さんは、その『君咲城の姫』に会うために大陸からきたの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「う～ん。ていうか母国でお家争いに巻きこまれて、逃げてきたの。父とふたりで、船でね。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「その船、運悪く嵐に巻きこまれて沈没しちゃったんだけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「あぁ、そういえば新撰組の詰め所でそんなような話を聞いたような……。それは、災難だったね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「うん。でもまぁ、船の乗組員は父も含めてみんな無事だったのが不幸中の幸い。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「さすがに怪我して動けないっぽくて、安全なところに隠れてもらってるけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシは運良く、怪我ひとつなく元気だったから。父に命じられて、『君咲城の姫』ってのを探してたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "つゆり",
    "text": "「ふぅん。どうして、その『君咲城の姫』……っていうのを探してるの？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 16,
    "dress": "old-shinsengumi",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-shinsengumi_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「う～ん。何でも、そのひとと接触できれば『ぜんぶうまくいく』って父が言ってたんだ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「どういう意味かは、よくわかんない」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ワタシたちには母国からも追っ手がかかってるし、この国には他に寄る辺もないから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「その『君咲城の姫』ってひとなら、保護してくれるのかもって期待してる」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「父がこの国で暮らしてたころの、古い友人とかなのかな？　と思ってるけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
