    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 448
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「それでね。元気なワタシはひとりで、とりあえず情報が集まりやすそうなところ……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「この遊廓とかで、『君咲城の姫』について聞きこみをしてたの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「でも、なかなか見知らぬ異国だと情報集めも難しくて……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「おまけにワタシを騙して変なことしようとした連中を叩きのめしたら、腕前を見込まれちゃってね」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「あとはご存知のとおり、用心棒をして日銭を稼いでたんだ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「役に立てば、『君咲城の姫』について教えてくれるって言われたし。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「父たちの、治療費がいるしね。ワタシたちは、この国の通貨をもってないし～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「えへへ、がんばって稼がないと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 472
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「でも悪いことをさせられるなんて、思ってなかったからさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "レンレン",
    "text": "「ごめんね昨日は、乱暴しちゃって。反省してるよ、今さら謝っても遅いだろうけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 48,
    "dress": "old-juban",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-juban_expression/sad",
